: 14}, {"depth": 2, "reference": 17}]}, {"c": 3, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 10}, {"depth": 2, "reference": 19}]}, {"c": 4, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 21}]}, {"c": 5, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 25}, {"depth": 2, "reference": 17}]}, {"c": 6, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 27}]}, {"c": 7, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 2}, {"depth": 2, "reference": 30}]}, {"c": 8, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 1}, {"depth": 2, "reference": 24}]}, {"c": 9, "r": 9, "layers": [{"depth": 0, "reference": 2}, {"depth": 2, "reference": 30}]}], "script": {"state": {}, "units": [], "structures": [], "events": [{"conditions": [{"type": "startGame"}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Mayday!  Tucker reporting in.  I'm under attack by unknown enemy forces.  Need support!", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "Hang in there, Tucker!  My flagship's hung up.  Critical engine failure.  I'm dead in the water until the engineers can get me up again. We're too far out for artillery support.", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I can't raise Argent on comm.  There's too much interference.  No response from General Pearl, either.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "You'll need to fight it out, then.  It looks like I was right about Mullen after all... he's not to be taken so lightly.", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "Those Rocket Trucks of yours should be able to bombard the enemy from across the river with their long range. You'll need to be careful, though, they can't move and fire. So, position them carefully. Good luck, soldier!", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "Tucker? You there? You get clear of that ambush? Tucker? Argent? Pearl? Anyone? Am I the only one left?", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true, "satisfied": true}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "General Pearl, if you can read me, my unit just fought off an ambush by enemy forces. I am unable to raise Captain Argent and Captain Durand\u2019s ships have been sabotaged.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "This was a coordinated ambush, and they knew what my position would be. Be careful, ma'am, they may also have the location of our home base! I\u2019m on my way to you now.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Durand, can you reach Argent yet?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "Nope.  Nothing.", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I repelled the ambush.  They shouldn't have anything in range to jam my signal anymore. Argent must be in trouble if we can't reach him.  Get your ships back up, I'm rolling to base.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "Soon as I can, Tucker.", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}]}}